{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DodgeAndRun is a simple, high-difficulty run-and-jump game set in a Japanese-style world. Use three different speeds strategically to keep moving forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A beautiful Japanese-style world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/0aa9dadad164f5012b91986485671c4a.poster.avif?t=1762057606\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/0aa9dadad164f5012b91986485671c4a.webm?t=1762057606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/0aa9dadad164f5012b91986485671c4a.mp4?t=1762057606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You become a nameless ninja, relentlessly advancing through this world. What awaits you at the end of this journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For now, nothing is known.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch freely between fixed and first-person cameras!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/301a305a2a6d1db346690dacd4fefd8b.poster.avif?t=1762057606\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/301a305a2a6d1db346690dacd4fefd8b.webm?t=1762057606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/301a305a2a6d1db346690dacd4fefd8b.mp4?t=1762057606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic fixed view or immersive first-person perspective?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choice changes your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy everything with the invincibility gauge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/c5b9bd2871e03854a4090a3c0402885a.poster.avif?t=1762057606\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/c5b9bd2871e03854a4090a3c0402885a.webm?t=1762057606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/extras/c5b9bd2871e03854a4090a3c0402885a.mp4?t=1762057606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy every unreasonable obstacle in your path! When players use their invincibility gauge, they become invincible for a set time, allowing them to destroy everything and push forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through stages by jumping and moving to avoid various obstacles (spikes, logs, blocks, etc.).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing a stage advances you to the next one. Clearing the final stage completes the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816710?t=1762057606","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/bbdd610f682ac14ad5488bf668aa84f2345d8a3f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762057606","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/6ab333c55899d2477ce3f804d9b1d48029407280/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762057606","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816710/6ab333c55899d2477ce3f80